00:08:49.395 --> 00:08:50.897
he can get removed from office,

00:08:50.897 --> 00:08:51.631
whether or not

00:08:51.631 --> 00:08:53.032
they can hold him accountable

00:08:53.032 --> 00:08:53.933
for any of this.

00:08:53.933 --> 00:08:54.834
Because when you look

00:08:54.834 --> 00:08:55.801
at some of the other law

00:08:55.801 --> 00:08:57.169
enforcement leaders,

00:08:57.169 --> 00:08:58.404
they've either been removed,

00:08:58.404 --> 00:09:00.106
they've resigned,

00:09:00.106 --> 00:09:01.407
there's been accountability.

00:09:01.407 --> 00:09:01.974
But with him,

00:09:01.974 --> 00:09:03.609
because he's an elected official

00:09:03.609 --> 00:09:05.444
and because he's the sheriff,

00:09:05.444 --> 00:09:07.179
it's not very clear

00:09:07.179 --> 00:09:08.681
to really anyone that I've talked to that

00:09:08.681 --> 00:09:10.216
there can be any accountability.

00:09:10.216 --> 00:09:11.250
We should also be clear,

00:09:11.250 --> 00:09:12.852
just we've had a number of family members

00:09:12.852 --> 00:09:14.420
on this program over the last month

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:14.987
as we continue

00:09:14.987 --> 00:09:17.189
to cover this and determine to do it.

00:09:17.189 --> 00:09:18.157
And you're doing extraordinary

00:09:18.157 --> 00:09:19.158
work on that.

00:09:19.158 --> 00:09:21.227
You talk to family members often.

00:09:21.227 --> 00:09:23.195
How did they feel about

00:09:23.195 --> 00:09:24.630
the sheriff's action?

00:09:24.931 --> 00:09:26.966
they have been raising a lot of concerns

00:09:26.999 --> 00:09:27.967
and a lot of questions

00:09:27.967 --> 00:09:29.635
about the sheriff's actions that day

00:09:29.635 --> 00:09:30.136
and the fact

00:09:30.136 --> 00:09:31.604
that he has not been open

00:09:31.604 --> 00:09:32.438
about what he did.

00:09:32.438 --> 00:09:33.873
He had 13 deputies.

00:09:33.873 --> 00:09:35.942
13 of his deputies were on scene there.

00:09:36.075 --> 00:09:37.543
Several of them were in the hallway.

00:09:37.543 --> 00:09:39.345
One of them actually was in a team

00:09:39.345 --> 00:09:40.546
that breached that classroom

00:09:40.546 --> 00:09:42.014
and killed the gunman.

00:09:42.014 --> 00:09:43.683
So they have felt that the sheriff

00:09:43.683 --> 00:09:44.917
has not been forthcoming.

00:09:44.917 --> 00:09:48.387
They feel that he has some culpability.

00:09:48.387 --> 00:09:49.555
They feel that he has some

00:09:50.523 --> 00:09:51.824
answers that they need

00:09:51.824 --> 00:09:53.025
for what happened here.

00:09:53.025 --> 00:09:53.960
The other thing what's interesting

00:09:53.960 --> 00:09:54.894
is that with the sheriff,

00:09:54.894 --> 00:09:56.596
when the House committee back in July,

00:09:56.596 --> 00:09:57.997
when they were doing their that Texas

00:09:57.997 --> 00:09:58.831
House committee

00:09:58.831 --> 00:10:00.466
was doing an investigation,

00:10:00.466 --> 00:10:02.034
they had called the sheriff to come in

00:10:02.034 --> 00:10:03.002
and give a deposition.

00:10:03.002 --> 00:10:04.570
He had initially refused,

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:05.605
claiming that, you know,

00:10:05.605 --> 00:10:06.973
there was this investigation.

00:10:06.973 --> 00:10:07.974
He couldn't cooperate.

00:10:07.974 --> 00:10:09.508
He ultimately cooperated.

00:10:09.508 --> 00:10:11.143
But people certainly in this community,

00:10:11.143 --> 00:10:11.811
you know, the mayor

00:10:11.811 --> 00:10:13.346
who I've talked to several times,

00:10:13.346 --> 00:10:14.347
all feel

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:15.715
that the sheriff

00:10:15.715 --> 00:10:16.682
is hiding something,

00:10:16.682 --> 00:10:18.150
that he's not been forthcoming

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.352
about information.

00:10:19.352 --> 00:10:20.653
So that is the way

00:10:20.653 --> 00:10:21.721
certainly the community

00:10:21.721 --> 00:10:23.356
and certainly families

00:10:23.356 --> 00:10:25.157
feel about the sheriff in front of us.

00:10:25.157 --> 00:10:26.325
Appreciate it. Thanks for reporting.

